1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,867
That's us. We walk to Union Yard
station. Eight hundred yards.

2
00:00:04,567 --> 00:00:07,200
Eight hundred yards? In a pitch-black
tunnel?

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:12,933
Rule seven. Never touch the third
rail. Not even now. Treat it like it's
always alive.

4
00:00:13,633 --> 00:00:15,067
But it stopped humming.

5
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:18,800
Power can come back any second.
Without a warning.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,300
Rule eight. Walk only on the catwalk.
One hand on the wall. Always.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,067
The catwalk. A concrete ledge, two
feet wide, along the tunnel wall.

8
00:00:28,767 --> 00:00:31,333
Then walk sideways. Down here, slow is
fast.
